<title>JAPAN: IGS OTC registration to be cancelled - JSDA.</title>
<headline>IGS OTC registration to be cancelled - JSDA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japan Securities Dealers' Association (JSDA) said on Friday that it would cancel the over-the-counter (OTC) registration of IGS Corp on April 18, after the software developer filed for bankruptcy.</p>
<p>IGS said earlier on Friday that it had filed for bankruptcy at Tokyo District Court due to financial difficulties.</p>
<p>Prior to IGS's announcement, trade in its shares had been suspended on the OTC market after rumours emerged that IGS had filed for bankruptcy.</p>
</text>
